{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-346078" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${\\int }_{0}^{3}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{3}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346078" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={e}^{x}\\,{|}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & ={e}^{3}-{e}^{0} \\\\  & ={e}^{3}-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346078" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "41705382eb0568dd5223226ab627ae763ed1d1889e0ad79ad3fb720a94859ac1"} {"question" "q-346078" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346078" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "e^3-1"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-103652" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${\\int }_{0}^{2}{10}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-103652" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{10}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{{10}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}{|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}\\cdot {10}^{x}\\,{|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}({10}^{2}-{10}^{0}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}(100-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{99}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-103652" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "41705382eb0568dd5223226ab627ae763ed1d1889e0ad79ad3fb720a94859ac1"} {"question" "q-103652" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-103652" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "100"] ["math" "99"] ["math" "99\\operatorname{ln}⁡10"] ["math" "\\frac{100}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}"] ["math" "\\frac{99}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-103652" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{99}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346074" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${\\int }_{1}^{2}{8}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{1}^{2}{8}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346074" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}{8}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{{8}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡8}{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡8}\\cdot {8}^{x}\\,{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡8}({8}^{2}-{8}^{1}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡8}(64-8) \\\\  & =\\frac{56}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346074" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "41705382eb0568dd5223226ab627ae763ed1d1889e0ad79ad3fb720a94859ac1"} {"question" "q-346074" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346074" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{56}{\\ln(8)}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-73272" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "${\\int }_{-3}^{0}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-73272" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-3}^{0}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={e}^{x}\\,{|}_{-3}^{0} \\\\  & ={e}^{0}-{e}^{-3} \\\\  & =1-\\frac{1}{{e}^{3}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-73272" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "41705382eb0568dd5223226ab627ae763ed1d1889e0ad79ad3fb720a94859ac1"} {"question" "q-73272" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/