aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346090" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "41705382eb0568dd5223226ab627ae763ed1d1889e0ad79ad3fb720a94859ac1"} {"question" "q-346090" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346090" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{3}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346084" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346084" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x{|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =0-(-1) \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346084" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "41705382eb0568dd5223226ab627ae763ed1d1889e0ad79ad3fb720a94859ac1"} {"question" "q-346084" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346084" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-73289" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "${\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{3\\pi /4}(-{csc}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-73289" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{3\\pi /4}(-{csc}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,{|}_{\\pi /3}^{3\\pi /4} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =-1-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+3}{3}.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-73289" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "41705382eb0568dd5223226ab627ae763ed1d1889e0ad79ad3fb720a94859ac1"} {"question" "q-73289" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-73289" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{1-\\sqrt{3}}{3}"] ["math" "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+1}{3}"] ["math" "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+3}{3}"] ["math" "\\frac{3-\\sqrt{3}}{3}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+3}{3}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-73289" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+3}{3}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346094" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346094" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\,{|}_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})-(-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}-(-2) \\\\  & =2-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}-2}{\\sqrt{3}}.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346094" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "41705382eb0568dd5223226ab627ae763ed1d1889e0ad79ad3fb720a94859ac1"} {"question" "q-346094" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346094" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346092" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}(-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}(-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346092" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}(-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-(-\\operatorname{sec}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =-\\sqrt{2}+1 \\\\  & =1-\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346092" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "41705382eb0568dd5223226ab627ae763ed1d1889e0ad79ad3fb720a94859ac1"} {"question" "q-346092" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "q-346092" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1-\\sqrt{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/state.json" "file_sha256" "aafcc9ae58a5e49e75662441713c9fdadb58c4f6ec076be2351ae3c0e7a577d1"} {"question" "e-6168" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^5 e^x \\, \\textrm d x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/example-6168.json" "file_sha256" "57dae555469552dd050465b75a709a86492aa9882276ad0c4496d0e06ef19102"} {"question" "e-6168" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{5}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={e}^{x}{|}_{0}^{5} \\\\  & ={e}^{5}-{e}^{0} \\\\  & ={e}^{5}-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/example-6168.json" "file_sha256" "57dae555469552dd050465b75a709a86492aa9882276ad0c4496d0e06ef19102"} {"question" "e-412" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate $\\displaystyle  \\int_{0}^{\\pi/2} \\cos x \\,\\textrm{d} x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/example-412.json" "file_sha256" "51339f33631ade6cb08f180f1da82c8f6d0a635adaee437bedbd653ff47ef4fc"} {"question" "e-412" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0) \\\\  & =1-0 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996204/example-412.json" "file_sha256" "51339f33631ade6cb08f180f1da82c8f6d0a635adaee437bedbd653ff47ef4fc"}] "usage" {"e-6168" [] "e-412" [] "q-73235" []} "basis" 1083 "retractions" [[17592186176484 :question/problem "What is $\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^{2}e^{x}dx$?"] [17592186175713 :question/problem "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^5 e^x \\, \\textrm d x$."] [17592186175713 :question/worked-solution "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int_{0}^{5}e^{x}dx &= \\left.e^{x}\\right|_{0}^{5} \\\\\n&= e^{5} - e^{0} \\\\\n&= e^{5} - 1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186175694 :question/problem "Evaluate $\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^{\\pi/2} \\cos x \\,\\textrm{d} x$."] [17592186175694 :question/worked-solution "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int_{0}^{π/2}\\cos xdx &= \\left.\\sin x\\right|_{0}^{π/2} \\\\\n&= \\sin (\\frac{π}{2}) - \\sin (0) \\\\\n&= 1 - 0 \\\\\n&= 1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186175447 17592186175448 17592186175449 17592186175450 17592186175451] "immutable_fields" [[17592186175446 :answer-field/correct] [17592186175446 :answer-field/id] [17592186175446 :answer-field/key] [17592186175446 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
